# GS22: from imil (continue with vale_day1_continue.keys + --flash-in): Imil's north exit, the World Map to Mercury Lighthouse;
# the exterior: round the dry fountain and up the stairs at column 46 to Mia, blocked by the statue (B taps through her lines);
# Move from 54,37 facing west pushes the statue to column 51 (mercury_lighthouse.c MercuryLighthouse_MiaOpensEntranceWithPly):
# 'Did you do that?' (B: No), Psynergy, Mia opens the door with Ply and goes in; through the door (scene 53); Cure Well on
# Ivan; past Mia into the Lizard Man: battlebot BB_SEQ 'RIGHT RIGHT A;A;A;RIGHT RIGHT RIGHT A;A;A;RIGHT A DOWN DOWN DOWN DOWN A
